    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG Declan woulfe are delighted to offer for sale No. 9 Daar Wood Newcastle West Nestled in the sought-after residential area of Daar Wood, No. 9 presents a superb opportunity to acquire a spacious detached two-storey residence ideal for modern family living.\r\n\r\nThis well-proportioned home offers a bright and welcoming interior, thoughtfully designed to maximise both comfort and functionality. The ground floor comprises a generous entrance hallway, a cosy yet elegant living room, and a large open-plan kitchen/dining area perfect for everyday living and entertaining. Additional reception space provides flexibility for a home office, playroom, or second lounge, while a convenient guest WC completes the ground floor layout.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property boasts multiple well-sized bedrooms, including a spacious master bedroom with en-suite, along with a family bathroom designed for practicality and comfort.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a private driveway offering ample off-street parking, along with a  garden to the rear—ideal for outdoor dining, relaxation, or family activities.\r\n\r\nLocated within easy reach of Newcastle West town centre, residents will enjoy close proximity to a range of amenities including schools, shops, restaurants, and leisure facilities, while also benefiting from excellent transport links.\r\n\r\nNo. 9 Daar Wood combines space, privacy, and convenience, making it an excellent choice for families or anyone seeking a quality home in a prime residential setting. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
